@port = 5121

@host = http://localhost:{{port}}

### Get all restaurants and their menus (Public)
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant

### Get all menus of specific restaurant (Public)
GET {{host}}/api/menuitem/01a0b4ce-5993-74aa-84f1-e2159ca68238


### Create a Restaurant (Requires Vendor JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tAgxo-XqM96x4C6wEw-g6mRD3p4x3_okJi6L0NHgyYw

{
  "name": "Cafe Amritsar",
  "description":"Authentic Amritsari cuisine with a modern twist.",
  "FullAddress": "Testing k maafik",
  "city":"Vadodara",
  "pinCode":"390009",
  "contactNumber":"9876543210"
}



### Add a Menu Item (Requires Vendor/Gordon's JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/menuitem
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Ovj9kuPxLrcT2eUlxKvslbKhc2xR_ndArUUXUhMf8jU

{
  "name": "Beef Wellington",
  "description": "A prime fillet of beef wrapped in puff pastry.",
  "category":"",
  "price": 45.99,
  "restaurantId": "01a0c29d-dbd9-758c-a4d0-1344b237992a"
}



### Add a Categorized Menu Item (Requires Vendor JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/menuitem
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Ovj9kuPxLrcT2eUlxKvslbKhc2xR_ndArUUXUhMf8jU

{
  "name": "Masala Dosa",
  "description": "Crispy crepe stuffed with spiced potatoes.",
  "price": 120.00,
  "category": "Dosa",
  "dietaryPreference": 0,
  "restaurantId": "01a0c2a1-a244-79fb-9603-9f1c2aea0293"
}


### Update a Menu Item (Requires Vendor JWT)
PUT {{host}}/api/menuitem/01a11005-b890-7e64-9899-048e90e4be4c
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tAgxo-XqM96x4C6wEw-g6mRD3p4x3_okJi6L0NHgyYw
# no need of -> "restaurantId": "REPLACE_WITH_RESTAURANT_ID"

{
  "name": "Italian Pizza",
  "description": "The real taste of Italy, you will experience the authentic flavors of Italy in every bite.",
  "price": 1040.00,
  "category": "Pizza",
  "dietaryPreference": 0
}

### Delete a Menu Item (Requires Vendor JWT)
DELETE {{host}}/api/menuitem/01a11083-d1cf-79a4-bf4d-4a330743ee19
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tAgxo-XqM96x4C6wEw-g6mRD3p4x3_okJi6L0NHgyYw


### GET /api/restaurant/my-restaurants (Requires JWT)
# Why: Right now the dashboard fetches every restaurant on the platform and filters it on the frontend. We need a secure endpoint that reads the OwnerId from the JWT and only returns restaurants owned by that specific vendor.
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant/my-restaurants
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tAgxo-XqM96x4C6wEw-g6mRD3p4x3_okJi6L0NHgyYw

### PUT /api/restaurant/{id} (Requires JWT)
# Why: For the VendorSettings tab. The vendor needs to be able to update their store description, change the address, or flip the isOpen boolean (Accepting/Closed toggle).
PUT {{host}}/api/restaurant/01a1109e-9460-7b5f-8197-524e4b58aeee
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tAgxo-XqM96x4C6wEw-g6mRD3p4x3_okJi6L0NHgyYw

{
  "name": "The Tulip Touche Cafe",
  "description":"Get your luxury right here",
  "FullAddress": "Alkapuri",
  "city":"Vadodara",
  "pinCode":"390009",
  "contactNumber":"9876543210"
}


# PUT /api/menuitem/{id} & DELETE /api/menuitem/{id} (Requires JWT)
# Why: You already have the POST to create menu items, but the VendorMenu tab needs endpoints to edit prices/descriptions or delete items entirely.

# GET /api/order/restaurant/{id} (Requires JWT)
# Why: To populate the VendorOrders tab. The backend needs to fetch all orders attached to the selected restaurant.

# PUT /api/order/{id}/status (Requires JWT)
# Why: Also for VendorOrders. The vendor needs to click buttons to advance the order state (e.g., changing status from "Preparing" to "Ready for Pickup").

# PUT /api/menuitem/{id}/availability (Requires Vendor JWT)
# Why: To handle the "In Stock" / "Out of Stock" toggle switch on the VendorMenu tab. It should just flip the boolean in the database without needing the full menu item payload (name, price, etc.).


# 📉 LOW PRIORITY 📉
# POST /api/upload/image (Requires Vendor JWT)
# Why: Currently, the restaurant and menu item POST requests only accept JSON text. We need a way for vendors to upload actual image files (multipart/form-data) for their restaurant banners and menu item photos. This should return the saved image URL so we can attach it to the POST/PUT payloads.

# GET /api/restaurant/{id}/stats (Requires Vendor JWT)
# Why: For the top row of the VendorSettings tab. We need an endpoint that returns real analytics for the selected restaurant: "Today's Revenue", "Completed Orders", and "Avg. Prep Time". Currently, those are hardcoded to ₹12,450 and 42 orders.